{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "388c9d3ca9dd2befdb66fba5b9cf9c2615d27ffef1ac404ce9e0e253188f3929", "ja": "（いよいよ明日は杏奈の初公演。765プロ劇場\nでのリハーサルも終えたし、準備は万端だ！）", "zh": "（明天就是杏奈的首次公演。\n在765艺能剧场的排练也结束了，准备就绪！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b1b270d0a360a271cd69580a780b4801d6b0d62d4d58e3521649e54d5ad1c6f7", "ja": "杏奈、まだ残ってたのか？\nこんな時間まで、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "杏奈，你还留着啊？\n怎么留到这么晚呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "1334dcb0817c885c82fb3ea3d2797c03c51f1e95ae957fa38e9db0766b95e2e2", "ja": "ちょっと……お話……したくて……。", "zh": "有一点……话……想说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "ebd0023abfdf1ec71dc1de45d89d3def6b12248e9dd9cb50279fd022cc476844", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n明日……失敗、したら……どう、しよ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n明天……要是，失败了……怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "22b4e83df69a8cccc6965b81f9d275807377a30cfc51be6d0bee5d35d4ea08db", "ja": "杏奈……大丈夫だ。この間の宣材撮影だって、\n評判よかったじゃないか。", "zh": "杏奈……没问题的。\n你前阵子的宣传照也大受好评呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "cdee8f74eef8d3a55bcab09588c4600a1719efa7fa16294dc26cbc6ea7246380", "ja": "レッスンが……終わって、から……ずっとドキドキ……\nしてて……胸が、ぎゅって……痛くて……。", "zh": "从训练……结束，以后……就一直……\n很紧张……胸口紧绷……好痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "733d25c1611ff7088cfd27290eb30f7eb2d3c907e772fab3d15f5204f8babf00", "ja": "（悪い方悪い方にばかり、考えが寄っているな。\nこういう時は……）", "zh": "（她一直往坏的方向想呢。\n这种时候就要……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_1008", "source_sha256": "a62aacf546f08f7117e10189742ef58c1d31b84273d8a009c48b00d2d5519eb2", "ja": "気分転換…！", "zh": "转换心情……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8b2298ea2d42777ac6c3fa7cb20e8cf18e212d6db6e554c7a15c00464a86a7fd", "ja": "杏奈、一度明日のことは忘れて、\n気分転換に、一緒にゲームでもしないか？", "zh": "杏奈，你先把明天的事抛在脑后。\n当作转换心情，要不要一起玩个游戏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2001_024ann", "source_sha256": "ac8335d91e64ccc11f2d945870d61bbaf0a677be1268d56e6d4260f11227a695", "ja": "ゲーム…………します。", "zh": "杏奈想…………玩游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2002_024ann", "source_sha256": "ff98545e5c7e89f7cc4ca50748c2f12c4aa585d76a66e101d93b8562430687ec", "ja": "{$P$}さん……準備……いい……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……你准备……好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "e8a7e8f0264156634dfa51c0655601ff4aab383694a416eb0362bf8d8ab4ecba", "ja": "ああ、いつでもいいぞ！", "zh": "嗯，随时都可以开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2004_024ann", "source_sha256": "75a38a5d9f9e0baf01b1787079c845a9f0f4aa5e1172e01ee5bc24832b1b8894", "ja": "ん……ゲーム……スタート……。", "zh": "嗯……游戏……开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
