{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2006_p", "source_sha256": "b2a89666ff38f5c6402afcb252136675ee1094ef262145cb6a3f3bba9fa220be", "ja": "うわあっ、いきなりやられた！\nな、なんだ今のは？　裏技か何かか！？", "zh": "唔哇，突然就被打倒了！\n刚、刚才那是怎么回事？是秘技之类的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2007_024ann", "source_sha256": "f990d62f764f0aa3f98201f5e01ff00bf7a9cf9f331e10a1e7a14f6268749097", "ja": "これ、は……こういう、技……。\n{$P$}さん……まだまだ……だね。", "zh": "这就是……这种，招式……\n{$P$}先生……你还……差得远呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2008_p", "source_sha256": "4b108e8bc7ebb066e60174cb99eaba8ad457d3f1bd7e2311ca1f56c29743dfe7", "ja": "そ、そうなのか。それじゃ仕方ないな……。\nよし、気を取り直して2回戦だ！", "zh": "是、是吗？那就没办法了……\n好，振作起来，开始第二回合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2009_null", "source_sha256": "79ed1bb81883d8f30e648448305c9caf78aeb8a43921ce366f3be5e3484ff011", "ja": "（1時間後……）", "zh": "（一个小时后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
