{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2011_p", "source_sha256": "e9343e1cbac14fc10037144478253826c715e00a78b016d1c0160d6a37349652", "ja": "はぁ……。杏奈、本当にゲーム強いんだな。\nまさか1回も勝てないなんて……。", "zh": "哇……杏奈，你玩游戏时真的很强呢。\n没想到我连一次都赢不了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2012_024ann", "source_sha256": "5fe932b7bfd6da46654068296f5a2fafc59b57539be7c7011e5c4852e5c7c8c9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nやりこみが足りない……。もっと練習、必要……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n你玩得不够深入……还需要，多多练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2013_024ann", "source_sha256": "15b8adf9f08ab86cb6912c9b42aa46efe5c8ecaf859a7206473ea15d2d703e65", "ja": "次に……期待してる、から……頑張って……ね……。", "zh": "期待你……下次的表现……要加油……喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "2bba16c94ebcd0e2a1cff5d660ee026faa442a2eb16a61a541feda65362cd714", "ja": "ああ、たくさん練習してくるよ。", "zh": "嗯，我会回去多多练习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2015_024ann", "source_sha256": "d2d43db2f2268d3b07f31ac245a40496dea2704f1252df67a2c0534e437dec62", "ja": "ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2016_024ann", "source_sha256": "3be30cfa25137e2d0388b395508fda72c262470f1d3c2786fd7a346874618d9e", "ja": "あの……、{$P$}さん。\n杏奈、……なんか、元気……出てきた……かも。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生。\n杏奈……觉得……好像，打起精神了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2017_p", "source_sha256": "4b8ad579a23fe26dda8c7f16ee57978924aba98800c1c4545b4f6440b0d34f75", "ja": "おっ、それはよかった。\nそれじゃ明日もゲームだと思って、気楽にいこうか。", "zh": "哦，那真是太好了。\n那就把明天也当成游戏，轻松面对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2018_024ann", "source_sha256": "09bc7f23c3aa72f2801098a8ae5c48e57397290ac4aa7432739dbd787d0fc561", "ja": "う……うん……。", "zh": "唔……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2019_p", "source_sha256": "bf00b59fc46784704b168ab91215b2b3a9136f7fe7d6cc7a1463c4448b82f62e", "ja": "大丈夫。杏奈は、たくさんレッスンしてきたんだ。\n何度も練習したことは、本番でもちゃんとできる。", "zh": "没问题的，杏奈已经做过很多训练了。\n练习过很多次的事，正式上场时一定也能好好办到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2020_p", "source_sha256": "0cf152d2f23d42d865dfe8afdc49b5016d7779c2701d9f156c0a09a709037005", "ja": "ほら、ゲームの技と同じだから。……な？", "zh": "你想想，就跟游戏的招式一样……知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2021_024ann", "source_sha256": "0f2566c75f3e39af1cb65a2aa72bcd5cab661fa74016a53ba5628c1597ffadbb", "ja": "あ……、ゲームの、技……。", "zh": "啊……游戏的招式……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2022_024ann", "source_sha256": "0e988e4ad5a417fbee8df241fd502d84e42b9829486e9bd692a2748b009d99b4", "ja": "はい……、{$P$}さん……。\nありがと……です。", "zh": "是啊……{$P$}先生……\n真是……谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2023_024ann", "source_sha256": "c3752db140ab1c31110aa6da49c01fe5f0a9fcab3c789812f737b3fdf8cb94d1", "ja": "本当にうまくできるか……わからない、けど……\n杏奈……、がんばります。応援して……くれる……？", "zh": "虽然不知道……能不能好好办到……\n但杏奈……会加油的。你会……帮忙加油吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_003_2024_p", "source_sha256": "642931740479edbaad71809a917d16f3cd22abdd0cfda279572a4db436beb0f7", "ja": "もちろん、一番近くで応援してるよ。\n明日は今日の続き、ラウンド2だ。頑張ってこい！", "zh": "那当然，我会在最近的地方帮你加油的。\n明天就是接在今天之后的第二回合，好好努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
